<section id="about" class="container py-5">
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-12"><h2 class="fw-bold mb-4"><span class="text-primary">#</span> About Me</h2></div>
        <div class="col-lg-8">
            <p class="fs-5 text-secondary">
                Hi there! I’m an IT student who just really loves building websites. I first got into coding because I wanted to know how the apps we use every day actually work behind the scenes. Now, I spend most of my time writing code, fixing bugs, and figuring out how to make sites look clean and easy to use.
            </p>
            <p class="fs-5 text-secondary">
                My main goal right now is to find a cool internship where I can learn from a real team and work on actual projects. When I’m not glued to my computer screen, I’m usually playing video games, trying out new food, or just hanging out with friends.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-lg-4 bg-light p-4 rounded shadow-sm">
            <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark mb-3">Academic Info</h5>
            <ul class="list-unstyled mb-0">
                <li class="mb-2"><strong>Program:</strong> @ViewData["Program"]</li>
                <li><strong>Status:</strong> @ViewData["Status"]</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>